# SakuraScore simulation subsystem — environment variables
#
# CORE SUBSYSTEM: no environment variables are required. The engine is
# deterministic, offline, and credential-free by design.
#
# The following are NOT used by the core subsystem and are listed only to make
# the future research-pipeline contract explicit (docs/RESEARCH_SOURCE_MAP.md §4):

# YouTube Data API v3 key (official API path for engagement metadata)
# YOUTUBE_API_KEY=

# Optional LLM endpoint — reserved for a future OASIS-backed adapter ONLY.
# The current engine never calls any LLM. Do not set unless you know why.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=
